# Battle against Regigigas (the colossal master of the Regis): the Regis' tapped code (short, short, long) alone
# on a pulse, waking bar by bar, then a slow A-minor choir over organ in bare parallel fifths. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Regigigas
tempo 140
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.1
reverb 0.4

track lead choir lowhp=sawlead vol=0.86 pan=0 rev=0.4
  r1 | r1 | r1 | r1 |
  L o4 a2. o5 c4 | o5 e2 d4 c4 | o5 d2. o4 b4 | o4 g2 a4 b4 |
  o5 c2. o4 a4 | o5 f2 e4 c4 | o4 b2. g+4 | o4 e1 |
  o5 e2 a4. g8 | o5 g2 e4 c4 | o5 f2 e4 d4 | o4 b2. o5 d4 |
  o5 c2 o4 a4 o5 c4 | o5 d2 o4 b4 o5 d4 | o5 e2 d4 o4 b4 | o4 e2 g+2 |

# The Regis' bare parallel fifths
track organ organ vol=0.36 pan=-0.2 rev=0.38
  r1 | r1 | o3 (a >e)1 | o3 (a >e)2 (g >d)2 |
  L o3 (a >e)1 | o3 (a >e)2 (g >d)2 | o3 (g >d)1 | o3 (g >d)2 (f >c)2 |
  o3 (f >c)1 | o3 (f >c)1 | o3 (e b)1 | o3 (e b)2 (d a)2 |
  o3 (a >e)1 | o4 (c g)1 | o3 (d a)1 | o3 (e b)1 |
  o3 (f >c)1 | o3 (g >d)1 | o3 (e b)1 | o3 (e b)2 (d a)4 (e b)4 |

track pad strings unless=lowhp vol=0.32 pan=0.3 rev=0.45
  r1 | r1 | r1 | o3 (a >e a)2 (g >d g)2 |
  L o3 (a >e a)1 | o3 (a >e a)2 (g >d g)2 | o3 (g >d g)1 | o3 (g >d g)2 (f >c f)2 |
  o3 (f >c f)1 | o3 (f >c f)1 | o3 (e b >e)1 | o3 (e b >e)2 (d a >d)2 |
  o3 (a >e a)1 | o4 (c g >c)1 | o3 (d a >d)1 | o3 (e b >e)1 |
  o3 (f >c f)1 | o3 (g >d g)1 | o3 (e b >e)1 | o3 (e b >e)2 (d a >d)4 (e b >e)4 |

# The Regis' code: short, short, long in sixteenths, in bare fifths
track code pulse vol=0.3 pan=0.3 rev=0.15
  o5 (a >e)16 (a >e)16 (a >e)8 r2. | o5 (a >e)16 (a >e)16 (a >e)8 r2. | o5 (a >e)16 (a >e)16 (a >e)8 r4 (a >e)16 (a >e)16 (a >e)8 r4 | o5 (a >e)16 (a >e)16 (a >e)8 r4 (g >d)16 (g >d)16 (g >d)8 r4 |
  L o5 (a >e)16 (a >e)16 (a >e)8 r4 (a >e)16 (a >e)16 (a >e)8 r4 | o5 (a >e)16 (a >e)16 (a >e)8 r4 (g >d)16 (g >d)16 (g >d)8 r4 |
  o5 (g >d)16 (g >d)16 (g >d)8 r4 (g >d)16 (g >d)16 (g >d)8 r4 | o5 (g >d)16 (g >d)16 (g >d)8 r4 (f >c)16 (f >c)16 (f >c)8 r4 |
  o5 (f >c)16 (f >c)16 (f >c)8 r4 (f >c)16 (f >c)16 (f >c)8 r4 | o5 (f >c)16 (f >c)16 (f >c)8 r4 (a >e)16 (a >e)16 (a >e)8 r4 |
  o5 (e b)16 (e b)16 (e b)8 r4 (e b)16 (e b)16 (e b)8 r4 | o5 (e b)16 (e b)16 (e b)8 r4 (d a)16 (d a)16 (d a)8 r4 |
  o5 (a >e)16 (a >e)16 (a >e)8 r4 (a >e)16 (a >e)16 (a >e)8 r4 | o5 (c g)16 (c g)16 (c g)8 r4 (c g)16 (c g)16 (c g)8 r4 |
  o5 (d a)16 (d a)16 (d a)8 r4 (d a)16 (d a)16 (d a)8 r4 | o5 (e b)16 (e b)16 (e b)8 r4 (e b)16 (e b)16 (e b)8 r4 |
  o5 (f >c)16 (f >c)16 (f >c)8 r4 (f >c)16 (f >c)16 (f >c)8 r4 | o5 (g >d)16 (g >d)16 (g >d)8 r4 (g >d)16 (g >d)16 (g >d)8 r4 |
  o5 (e b)16 (e b)16 (e b)8 r4 (e b)16 (e b)16 (e b)8 r4 | o5 (e b)16 (e b)16 (e b)8 r4 (e b)16 (e b)16 (e b)8 r4 |

